I do like the idea of amnesia and that it would extend to spells and 
skills. I'm unsure of completely forgetting dungeon levels.
Intrinsics should remain if they come from crowning since you have been 
reincarnated in the Dungeons of Doom by the will of your deity. Intrinsics 
acquired from level gain would be lost and new ones appropriate to your 
class would take their place. AC bonuses from the protection racket would 
also remain. Plus I'd say that when one finds their corpse it would be like 
a normal bones pile where most objects end up being cursed.
As for the amulet of reincarnation, if it ends up being blessed then 
there's a greater chance you'll be reborn in the same race and class. Of 
course you'd still have to hunt down your corpse to get your stuff back.
Remaining the same experience level at the time of reincarnation would give 
the reborn a fighting chance at crossing the dungeon and getting their 
stuff back.

